 null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Flappy VR", "keywords": ["flappy", "bird", "flappybird"], "long_description": "Flappy VR: The Skyward Trial\nStep inside the wings of the world\u2019s most famous bird!\n\nForget tapping a screen\u2014it\u2019s time to use your own strength to stay airborne. Flappy VR takes the addictive \"one-more-try\" gameplay you love and transforms it into a fully immersive, 360-degree heart-pounding challenge.\n\nEvery pipe is a giant obstacle, and every flap counts. Do you have the wingspan and the nerves to navigate the narrow gaps and claim the high score?\n\nCore Features:\nPhysical Flight Mechanics: Use your VR controllers to physically flap your wings. Feel the rhythm and the burn as you fight gravity in real-time.\n\nImmersive First-Person View: Experience a terrifying sense of scale and height. Those pipes aren't just icons anymore\u2014they are towering obstacles!\n\nVibrant 3D Worlds: Fly through beautifully rendered environments optimized for a smooth, high-comfort experience on Meta Quest.\n\n\nInstant Restart: No menus, no waiting. Just pure, addictive gameplay that keeps you coming back for \"just one more round.\"\n\nThe sky is calling. How far can you fly before the wings give out?", "short_description": "Flap your wings to survive! Experience the ultimate high-stakes flight in VR."}]}, "developer_name": "DiscoveryMe Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://discoverystudio.online/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://discoverystudio.online/#contact", "publisher_name": "DiscoveryMe Studio", "support_website_url": "https://discoverystudio.online/terms-of-use", "website_url": "https://discoverystudio.online/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUI